  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3f7b18af-47b0-5e8f-bd8d-ba2ed92ed3e7" activityNameId="5195a159-5061-5ab2-a992-caf93edd9f7d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Single cell, lithium-ion battery, LiFePO4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Single cell, lithium-ion battery, LiFePO4
Assumption that all components of a LiFePO4 cell are similar to the NCM battery cell except the cathode.;
UUID: f2c50d54-8dad-3cfb-a31b-7b1501cf2d06
All components of the battery cell: Anode, Cathode, Electrolyte, Separator, Cell container, as well as the energy, transport and facility required for the LiPO4 battery cell production.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Electricity production for own consumption  with battery-connected photovoltaic power plants mounted on buildings slanted roof. 922 kWh/kWp annual electricity output, 1117 kWh/m2 irradiation, 0.75 performance ratio, 13.2% module efficiency.
Time period: Calculation of yield based on production with a state of the art plant.
Production volume: In 2008 there were 3'875 PV-plants with an annual production of 33'400 MWh
Sampling: Statistical data for CH 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f2c50d54-8dad-3cfb-a31b-7b1501cf2d06.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
